{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-12-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'DOVER FUELING SOLUTIONS COLLABORATES WITH ACI WORLDWIDE ON DATA SECURITY OFFERING FOR INCREASED FUEL PUMP SECURITY', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., DEC. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DOVER FUELING SOLUTIONS ("DFS"), A PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV) AND A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF ADVANCED CUSTOMER-FOCUSED TECHNOLOGIES, SERVICES AND SOLUTIONS IN THE FUEL AND CONVENIENCE RETAIL INDUSTRIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED A COLLABORATION WITH ACI WORLDWIDE ON A POINT-TO-POINT ENCRYPTION (P2PE) DATA SECURITY OFFERING.'}